  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n{(28 - 33) + 99} + 136 ÷ 4 × 5 - (44 - 22)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/63e3fd54db77dff5e0d64f39578116d3ccc79809bfa961f0716ef633bf7ad2d4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nTherefore, \n\n{(28 - 33) + 99} + 136 ÷ 4 × 5 - (44 - 22) \n\n= {(28 - 27) + 99} + 136 ÷ 4 × 5 - (44 - 4) \n\n= 100 + 136 ÷ 4 × 5 - 40 = 100 + 34 × 5 - 40 \n\n= 100 + 170 - 40 = 270 - 40 = 230\n\n**Hence, {(28 - 33) + 99} + 136 ÷ 4 × 5 - (44 - 22) = 230.**",
